      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DIM SIM NODDY (1) found trouble in the run at this course and distance last time and failed to finish. Tough to beat on best and worth another try. ROLLING EXPRESS (7) produced a moderate run last time when fifth at Geelong over 400m behind Pretty Panama (23.81) in a Bottom Up - Grade 5. Expected to give a good account. BIT OF ROMANCE (2) was safely held last time out, finishing eighth at Traralgon over 425m behind Jumbuk Funi (25.67) in a Grade 5. Some good form is emerging from his last run. Great chance to atone. FOLLOW THE SUN (3) was out of the money at this circuit last start but can turn the form around.",
